00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:50,930
A service = configuration for one or more identical containers.

87
00:05:51,467 --> 00:05:51,929
image:

88
00:05:51,929 --> 00:05:53,547
uses an image, build:

89
00:05:53,547 --> 00:05:55,087
builds one; command:

