290
00:20:31,588 --> 00:20:35,447
For investigating and administering what is running.

291
00:20:35,447 --> 00:20:38,787
docker compose run SERVICE CMD creates a new,

292
00:20:38,787 --> 00:20:44,651
separate container from the service's configuration and runs the command there.

293
00:20:44,651 --> 00:20:45,912
For one-off jobs:

294
00:20:45,912 --> 00:20:47,916
migrations, tests, scripts.

